    kind: invariant  # 98ee
    title: "17 dual-classified io_primitives rows across 6 languages; the catalogue cannot express WHY a primitive has two boundaries, so each consumer breaks the tie its own way"  # 98ee
    status: violated  # 98ee
    priority: 2  # 98ee
    parent:  # 98ee
    tags:  # 98ee
